argins measure REMOVED_DATE  cm or greater   STAINS FOR RECEPTORS  Requested on block  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID        GROSS DESCRIPTION   Received are 2 containers which are each  labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME   REMOVE_MRN       Received fresh  labeled  left breast   is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 7 5cm  mastectomy  specimen with a short suture designating the superior  a long suture  designating the lateral and an extra stitch designating axillary tail  The  overlying REMOVED_DATE x 3 5cm nipple and areola appear unremarkable  The anterior  margin of the specimen is inked blue  the posterior margin is inked black  The  specimen consists of yellow white  fibrofatty tissue with focal hemorrhagic  areas and nodular areas  Four possible lymph nodes are identified in the  lateral tissue  Also received within the container is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 2 0cm  aggregate of unremarkable pieces of fibroadipose tissue  The following  representative sections are submitted      REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Representative upper outer quadrant    REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Representative upper inner quadrant    REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Representative lower inner quadrant    REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Representative lower outer quadrant    REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Representative central breast    REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   4 possible lymph nodes    REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Representative sections of additional pieces of fat     Received fresh  labeled  right breast   is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 7 0cm  mastectomy  specimen with a short suture designating the superior  a long suture  designating the lateral and an extra stitch designating axillary tail  The  overlying REMOVED_DATE x 4 5cm nipple and areola appear unremarkable  The anterior  margin of the specimen is inked blue  and the posterior margin is inked black   The specimen contains a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 6cm ill defined  stellate  white  indurated area within the central outer aspect of the breast  subjacent to the  lateral aspect of the areola  which extends to 6 0cm of the posterior margin  and 2 0cm of the anterior margin  No clip is identified  The surrounding  tissue is white yellow and fibrofatty  Specimen also contains a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x  0 9cm ill defined  tan pink to yellow  indurated mass in the central outer  breast  which extends to 7 0cm of the posterior margin and abuts the anterior  margin  and is 3 0cm lateral to mass  1  The mass contains a clip  The  specimen also contains a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 5cm dumb bell shaped  indurated mass  within the upper outer quadrant  which extends to 4 5cm of the posterior  margin and 3 0cm of the anterior margin  and is 4 0cm lateral to mass  1   Three possible lymph nodes are identified in the lateral tissue  Also received  within the container is an REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 3 0cm aggregate of unremarkable pieces  of fibroadipose tissue  The following representative sections are submitted      REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Mass  1 entirely submitted    REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Representative section of fibroadipose tissue between mass  1 and mass  2      REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Mass  2 entirely submitted with the section containing the clip in  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   and a representative nearest posterior margin in  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID     REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Representative section of fibroadipose tissue between mass  2 and mass  3    REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Mass  3 entirely submitted    REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Representative sections of fibroadipose tissue away from all masses      REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   3 possible lymph nodes    REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Representative sections of separately received piece of fibroadipose  tissue       Final Diagnosis by John H Eichhorn M D   Electronically signed on Thursday  REMOVED_MONTH 23   REMOVED_CASE_ID  at 04 36 06PM  By his her signature above  the pathologist listed as making the Final  Diagnosis certifies that he she has personally reviewed this case and confirmed  or c