partment at the Massachusetts General Hospital  They have not been cleared or approved by the U S  Food and Drug Administration  FDA   The FDA has determined that such clearance or approval is not necessary  this laboratory has established and verified the test s accuracy and precision  Added by  Grace T  McKee MD Signed On  16 REMOVED_MONTH 01 at 17 41     ELECTRON MICROSCOPY Addendum          ELECTRON MICROSCOPY ADDENDUM    REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID        BREAST TUMOR   SPINDLE CELL NEOPLASM WITH FEATURES SUGGESTIVE OF FIBROBLASTIC DIFFERENTIATION  SEE NOTE  NOTE  The tissue was formalin fixed and is not optimally preserved  The tumor cells are embedded in extracellular collagenous matrix  They are cohesive and intercellular junctions are prominent  The cytoplasm has an admixture of dilated and non dilated rough endoplasmic reticulum  free ribosomes  mitochondria and filaments  No definitive features of epithelial differentiation are seen  The findings are consistent with a mesenchymal neoplasm  however  similar ultrastructural features can be seen in sarcomatoid carcinoma  which cannot be excluded  Added by  Gunnlaugur P  Nielsen  MD Signed On  20 REMOVED_MONTH 01 at 16 22 GROSS DESCRIPTION  Received fresh  labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name  unit number and  left breast  is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 3 5cm portion of breast with a REMOVED_DATE x 10 0cm unremarkable tan skin ellipse and an REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1 5cm axillary tail  Specimen is black inked and serially sectioned to reveal a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 2 5cm white gritty well delineated mass located 2 0cm from the deep and 2 5cm from the skin margins  The remaining parenchyma is 90  yellow lobulated fatty tissue and 10  thin white fibrous tissue surface  Within the attached axillary tail are multiple tan pink rubbery lymph nodes ranging from 0 3cm to 4 0cm in greatest dimension  Representative section of tumor is saved frozen  Representative sections are submitted as follows  A 